  "body": "### Summary\nAs a logged-out reader, I want the Messages tab to show legacy's sign-in prompt with « Ajouter un pseudo », as Favoris and the topic list do since #824, so that the three tabs read alike.\n\n### Scope\n- Legacy: `MPListView.swift:588` @ 87fe0d1c. Read the exact wording, icon and action there, and cite them.\n- SwiftHFR: the Messages list keeps its current logged-out wording (noted in GAP-037 by PR #1316).\n- Reuse #1316's `SignInPrompt` and the existing login entry (`LoginView(target: .newAccount)`, or the accounts sheet when the store has a problem).\n\n### Blocked by\n#1316\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Logged out, Messages shows legacy's prompt and its button opens the login.\n- [ ] A model test fails before the change.\n- [ ] A GAP-037 `gap-edit` in `### Ledger`.\n\nFound by w824 while working on #824.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
